{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-tranquil-wellness-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"tranquil-wellness-residences-urban-wellness-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","about":"Tranquil Wellness Residences is a health hotel complex from the developer Urban Wellness. The goal of Tranquil Wellness Residences is to provide clients with a luxurious yet mindful experience of a healthy lifestyle. Additionally, it is an ideal investment opportunity. The forty-story building features innovative design and fully embodies the contemporary trends of elite urban living. Clients can choose from 10 unique layouts.Our apartments are perfect for families who love to travel but also want to enjoy the comforts of home. Each apartment has a unique theme and color scheme. The complex offers apartments from cozy studios to spacious two-bedroom apartments with a cabinet. Each serviced apartment comes fully furnished, including an equipped kitchen and household appliances. All apartments feature a large balcony with stunning views. Among the amenities are modern air purification and aromatherapy. Tranquil Wellness Residences offers many options for forming healthy habits, including a cardio gym, yoga studio, boxing ring, Olympic-sized pool, saunas, and much more.Another advantage of the project is a superbly equipped business center, consistent with the hotel's overall philosophy of a healthy lifestyle.Located in the heart of the Jumeirah Village Triangle, the complex is close to Dubai's most thriving communities, including Jumeirah Village Circle, Jumeirah Park, Emirates Hills, and Sports City. Dubai Marina is just a 10-minute drive away, Downtown Dubai is 15 minutes away, and Palm Jumeirah is 18 minutes away. Dubai International Airport is only a 24-minute drive from the hotel.","price":1667527,"title":"Tranquil Wellness Residences","bitrix":{"id":906,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id"